      "writtenOn": "2025-08-05T15:24:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok so the semantic of the serial is an \"UnbarrieredSegment\" of commands? On the recording context we know which segment we are on, the buffer has a `mLastWriteSegment` and the recording context has a `mLastBarrieredSegmentWith` map?",
      "parentUuid": "f93268ae_ffd66fb1",
      "revId": "8f46df7b7e60836940138121fc9f87dfc259eedb",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
